# Day 17 – Vehicle Cost Analysis Dashboard

## Objective

The objective of this task was to analyze a vehicle cost dataset using AI and generate an interactive HTML dashboard. The dashboard provides insights into fuel costs, maintenance expenses, environmental impact, and E85 fuel economics through responsive KPI cards and SVG-based visualizations.

