## Learnings

* Learned how AI can automatically analyze CSV datasets and generate a complete HTML dashboard.
* Improved understanding of vehicle cost metrics such as Cost per Kilometer, CO₂ per Kilometer, and Maintenance Cost per Kilometer.
* Gained knowledge about E85 fuel economics, including pump savings, running penalties, break-even price, and scoring methodology.
* Learned to build responsive dashboards using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and SVG without external libraries.
* Practiced documenting project outcomes and publishing work through GitHub for portfolio development.

